WEBVTT

00:20:57.086 --> 00:21:00.827
LS: The whole process
could take almost two years

00:21:00.851 --> 00:21:04.412
and maybe a handful
of people would read it.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:09.985
And so, as I began to get
more followers on Instagram

00:21:10.009 --> 00:21:12.720
and I began to do more things,

00:21:12.744 --> 00:21:15.508
you know, for example, I did a short film

00:21:15.532 --> 00:21:18.899
and within a couple of weeks,

00:21:18.923 --> 00:21:22.636
that was in front of,
you know, millions of people.

00:21:24.187 --> 00:21:26.864
AG: Lyn went about as far
from her original field of work

00:21:26.888 --> 00:21:28.070
as she could go.

00:21:28.094 --> 00:21:30.505
So what leads to a spectacular
pivot like that?